WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.067
-And, finally, it is Wednesday,

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.200
and we all know what that means.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.367
It's time for some
"Monday Motivations."

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.767
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:11.200
♪♪

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.968
You're so popular,
when someone says November,

00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:17.033
everyone else is like, "Oh, you
mean McKenzie's birthday month?"

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:20.234
[ Applause ]

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:22.033
After they welcome you
onto the flight,

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:24.200
the pilots go into the cockpit,
shut the door behind them,

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.467
and go, "Oh, my God,
he's here.

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:26.567
Be cool, be cool."

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:30.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.934
No matter what you went as
for Halloween,

00:00:31.934 --> 00:00:34.400
people assumed
you were the sexy version.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:38.234 --> 00:00:39.934
Go ahead, say you're vegan.

00:00:39.934 --> 00:00:41.067
People care.

00:00:41.067 --> 00:00:45.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.133
When you read on the subway,
everyone's like,

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:49.067
"Oh, he's the full package."

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:52.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:55.200
If you'd been on stage
that night, John Wilkes Booth

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.601
would've been like,
"Forget Abe Lincoln.

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:58.300
I want to see
the rest of this play."

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:01.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:03.534
And finally, this year,
your uncle's gonna show up

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:05.767
to Thanksgiving like,
"I've given it some thought,

00:01:05.767 --> 00:01:07.734
and I realize, you're right."

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:08.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:09.801
There you go.
Thank you.

00:01:09.801 --> 00:01:11.033
We have a great show, everyone.

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:13.834
Octavia Spencer is here tonight!

00:01:13.834 --> 00:01:16.801
[ Cheers and applause ]
Octavia!

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:19.400
Matthias Schweighofer
is on the show!

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:20.701 --> 00:01:22.434
And we've got great stand-up
from Kurt Braunohler.

00:01:22.434 --> 00:01:23.667
Stick around.

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:25.634
We're playing "Catchphrase"
when we come back.

